      },
      "message": "fix(mcp): list_features facing follows the facet winding, bottom caps read down\n\nThe face plane normal is sign-canonical (winding-free), so a bottom cap\nshared the top cap's +Z normal and read \"up\". Flip it to the outward side\nfrom the summed facet winding before reporting normal/facing.\n\nFixes #884\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
