      "message": "fix(mcp): list_features reads pick::align::outward_normal, normal reported where the part sits\n\nDrops #947's second outward() helper; list_features calls the one\noutward_normal the WCS picks use (now pub(crate)), which flips to the\nfacets' outside and turns by the part's placement. A face it refuses\n(open or inside-out shell) keeps the canonical normal, placed.\n\nFixes #956\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
